<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Dotnet, Diagnosis - 标签 - free note</title><link>https://blog.frhello.com/tags/dotnet-diagnosis/</link><description>Dotnet, Diagnosis - 标签 - free note</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>qjdev@qq.com (feng rui)</managingEditor><webMaster>qjdev@qq.com (feng rui)</webMaster><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 14 Dec 2021 23:25:19 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.frhello.com/tags/dotnet-diagnosis/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Dotnet 程序诊断</title><link>https://blog.frhello.com/dotnet-%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AF%8A%E6%96%AD/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Dec 2021 23:25:19 +0800</pubDate><author>作者</author><guid>https://blog.frhello.com/dotnet-%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%AF%8A%E6%96%AD/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="dotnet-counters-性能诊断">dotnet-counters 性能诊断</h2>
<h3 id="介绍">介绍</h3>
<p><a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/zh-cn/dotnet/core/diagnostics/dotnet-counters" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer">https://docs.microsoft.com/zh-cn/dotnet/core/diagnostics/dotnet-counters</a></p>
<h3 id="安装">安装</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">dotnet tool install --global dotnet-counters
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="收集">收集</h3>
<p>查看可监视的 <code>dotnet</code> 进程列表</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">dotnet-counters ps
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>以 3 秒的刷新间隔时间收集所有计数器的值，并生成 csv 输出文件：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">dotnet-counters collect --process-id <span class="m">1902</span> --refresh-interval <span class="m">3</span> --format csv
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p>实时监控</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>